<title>USA: American Energy drilling funded.</title>
<headline>American Energy drilling funded.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Energy Group Ltd said Monday a consortium of European investors lead by Cominvest Research AG of Zurich has funded $1.2 million as the initial phase of a drilling joint venture for the development of American Energy's Blue Ridge field Project in Fort Bend County, Texas.</p>
<p>This venture is a result of the successful five well pilot drilling project initiated by the company in November 1996.</p>
<p>The company said it expects to start additional development drilling in Blue Ridge Field in late March and to continue drilling in this field throughout 1997.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
